  "caption": {
    "en": "After a downtrend: selling climax (SC), automatic rally (AR), secondary test (ST), a spring below the range, a sign of strength (SOS) and a last point of support (LPS). Buy the LPS at 1.0988.",
    "bn": "Downtrend-এর পর: selling climax (SC), automatic rally (AR), secondary test (ST), range-এর নিচে spring, sign of strength (SOS), শেষে last point of support (LPS)। LPS-এ 1.0988-এ buy।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "A Wyckoff range is a sequence to be read in order; the entry came after strength was shown, not at the first dip.",
    "bn": "Wyckoff range একটি ক্রম, যা পরপর পড়তে হয়; entry এসেছে strength দেখানোর পর, প্রথম dip-এ নয়।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Buy evidence of strength, not just a low",
      "bn": "শুধু low নয়, strength-এর প্রমাণে buy করুন"
    }
  ],
